* In Japanese {{w|kanji}}, this character is encoded with a slightly different form. The component {{l|mul|术}} is written under the grass radical, giving the form of <span style="font-size:=large;" lang=zh-hans>[[𦬸#Translingual|𦬸]]</span> which is enclosed by <span style="font-size:x-large;" lang=ja>[[辶#Translingual|辶]]</span> as its bottom left component.
