* In mainland China: <span style="font-size:x-large;" lang=zh-hans>[[艹#Translingual|艹]]</span> (3 strokes) + <span style="font-size:x-large" lang=zh-hans>[[辶#Translingual|辶]]</span> (3 strokes) + <span style="font-size:x-large; lang=zh-hans>{{l|mul|术}}</span> (5 strokes) - Total: 11 strokes
